###  http://meteo_onto.org/meteo_risk/School
Risk:School rdfs:subClassOf dbo:School .


###  http://meteo_onto.org/meteo_risk/WeatherEvent
Risk:WeatherEvent rdfs:subClassOf dbo:Event .


